Pamela Tola receives huge compensation for mold house
Actress Pamela Tola and her ex-husband Pauli Waroma, Managing Director Pauli Waroma, have won a tough dispute about an apartment they bought in Espoo in 2009.
The purchase price of a two-storey detached house had amounted to €333,000.
