Republican presidents of the Subcommittee for Intelligence and Defense Qualifications of the U.S. House of Representatives (House Armed Services Committee) set up a working group whose interim report details "general dissatisfaction of armed reconnaissance analysts." Analysts said senior military officials embellished their estimates of American actions against ISIS.
